    "detailed_description": "\u25c6 Game Features<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbOverview<br />\r\nFill three trains with animals, create chains, and aim for a high score. Animals can't board trains with station staff, so sneak past them and rush to the open doors.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbScoring System<br />\r\nThe more you chain animals, the higher your score. You can keep boarding animals until you run out of lives.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbStamina System<br />\r\nAnimals lose stamina when they touch station staff or as time passes. Chaining animals restores stamina, but as time progresses, the rate of stamina depletion increases.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbRanking System<br />\r\nView global rankings online.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSupported Languages: Japanese, English<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeveloped by a team of four students. Game streaming is highly encouraged.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor emergencies, bugs, or inquiries, please contact us via the email address on the store page.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u203b Even with supported versions, there may be instances where the game doesn't run properly due to device specifications. In such cases, we kindly ask you to proceed with Steam's refund process.",
    "about_the_game": "\u25c6 Game Features<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbOverview<br />\r\nFill three trains with animals, create chains, and aim for a high score. Animals can't board trains with station staff, so sneak past them and rush to the open doors.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbScoring System<br />\r\nThe more you chain animals, the higher your score. You can keep boarding animals until you run out of lives.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbStamina System<br />\r\nAnimals lose stamina when they touch station staff or as time passes. Chaining animals restores stamina, but as time progresses, the rate of stamina depletion increases.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fbRanking System<br />\r\nView global rankings online.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSupported Languages: Japanese, English<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDeveloped by a team of four students. Game streaming is highly encouraged.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor emergencies, bugs, or inquiries, please contact us via the email address on the store page.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u203b Even with supported versions, there may be instances where the game doesn't run properly due to device specifications. In such cases, we kindly ask you to proceed with Steam's refund process.",
    "short_description": "Dive into the chain boarding game &quot;DOASHIME - Close the Door!&quot; and fill the train with cute animals. While avoiding being spotted by station staff, chain same-colored animals for points, and ensure they board. Score until the last second and ascend to the top of the global rankings.",
